{%- comment -%}
  Product JSON-LD for custom PDP sections. Dawn's main-product section
  normally outputs this, but every custom PDP template replaces it — so
  without this snippet the product pages ship NO Product structured data
  (no rich results, no price/availability in Google, weaker free Shopping
  listings). Uses Shopify's native structured_data filter so the output
  always stays valid and complete (name, image, offers, brand, sku).

  Usage: {% render 'panstellar-product-schema', product: product %}
  (pass the section's own product variable when it differs, e.g. ndl_product)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if product != blank -%}
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {{ product | structured_data }}
  </script>
{%- endif -%}
